- **One method per phase**, each just building a hash and calling the shared `write_log`:
  - `iteration(n:, max:)` → `{phase: "iteration", n:, max:}`
  - `limit_reached(kind:, n:, max:)` → `{phase: "limit_reached", kind:, n:, max:}`
  - `turn_end(reason:, iterations:, tokens: nil)` → `{phase: "turn_end", reason:, iterations:, tokens:}`
